{
  "about": "Blue Hour's Blender style sheet as data (BACKLOG.md 'Blue Hour: Blender assets' B1). validate.mjs reads it. Bytes are KiB x 1024. extent is the longest side a class may have, in metres; each item's box is the builder's box it replaces, held to 10% per axis. texture is the largest image side in pixels, and 0 means none. clips are the clip names an item must carry, exactly; nodes are the node names the game finds and poses itself, and each must be in the file. The palette is every colour js/wildlife.js, js/props.js and js/forest.js draw with, named for what wears it.",
